  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Application of a Global Information System on Aquatic Genetic Resources for Food and Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support countries to enhance their knowledge and understanding of aquatic genetic resources (AqGR) and their capacity to monitor, in the long term, the status of conservation, sustainable use and development of these resources. The project will support countries to develop national registries of AqGR that will inform their future management of these resources including implementation of relevant elements of the Global Plan of Action.</narrative>
  </description>
